    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/0b69baa1eabd5279a73fd57f80d6d5a0.poster.avif?t=1748643688\" width=640 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/0b69baa1eabd5279a73fd57f80d6d5a0.webm?t=1748643688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino Cleanup</strong> is a clean-a-thon platformer with physics-elements and a retro aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toxic goop has spread across the dinosaur land! Suck up the mess with your trusty vacuum and save the dinosaurs trapped in the muck. Jump, dash, vacuum, and explore multiple levels full of physics-based fun in a 3D world with 2D pixel sprites! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/d7b505bcfab2d3313a74272993a9270d.poster.avif?t=1748643688\" width=640 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/d7b505bcfab2d3313a74272993a9270d.webm?t=1748643688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd96 Explore multiple levels by platforming, interacting with physics objects using your vacuum, and be rewarded for cleaning each level fully </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd95 Make dinosaur friends by saving them from the goop, and chat with them back at the hub </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udf0b Unlock new abilities, revealing new ways to play, explore, and clean more efficiently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\udd5a Pull and push physics-based objects using your trusty vacuum</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/019d3ed918ffc863fa469accf6d54c3b.poster.avif?t=1748643688\" width=640 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/019d3ed918ffc863fa469accf6d54c3b.webm?t=1748643688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
