hysics-based objects using your trusty vacuum</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/019d3ed918ffc863fa469accf6d54c3b.poster.avif?t=1748643688\" width=640 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031750/extras/019d3ed918ffc863fa469accf6d54c3b.webm?t=1748643688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
